# C++ Conventions

## Class member order (`.hpp`)

Within each class, declare members in this order:

1. Nested types (`Params`, `Info`, `Result`, …)
2. Constructors / destructor
3. Getters and simple accessors
4. Public API (`run`, `releaseResult`, …)
5. Private methods
6. Member variables

## Implementation order (`.cpp`)

1. File-level helpers (anonymous namespace or `static` free functions) first
2. Classes in the same order as they appear in the header
3. Within each class, implement methods in the same order as declared in the header (skip inline-only methods)

## Naming

- 类型（class、struct、enum、using、typedef）：PascalCase，如 `ImageBuffer`、`TensorView`
- 函数与局部/全局变量：snake_case，如 `load_model`、`batch_size`
- 类成员变量：snake_case + 尾下划线，如 `model_path_`、`is_ready_`
- 枚举值（enum class 成员）：PascalCase，如 `Status::Ok`、`Color::Red`
- 编译期常量：k 前缀 + PascalCase，如 `kMaxBatchSize`、`kDefaultTimeout`
- 宏：全大写 + 下划线，如 `DISALLOW_COPY`、`MAX_BUFFER_SIZE`
- 源文件与头文件：snake_case，如 `image_processor.cpp`、`tensor_view.hpp`